{"text": " Always be a good person, even if nothing comes back in return, even if they don't care, even if nobody is seeing it. Being kind is not a strategy, it is a decision, it's not about what you want or what you receive in return. It is about who you choose to be when no one else is watching. So stay kind, because that is something no one can take away from you. The world will not always reward gentleness. Some days kindness will feel unnoticed. Some days it will feel misunderstood. But what you carry in your heart shapes the way you walk through this life. When you choose kindness, you protect your own peace. You keep your heart open in a world that often teaches people to close it. And even when no one thanks you, your spirit knows the truth. It knows who you are becoming.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.86, "text": " Always be a good person, even if nothing comes back in return,", "tokens": [50364, 11270, 312, 257, 665, 954, 11, 754, 498, 1825, 1487, 646, 294, 2736, 11, 50630], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18878778785166114, "compression_ratio": 1.6886792452830188, "no_speech_prob": 0.16173210740089417, "words": [{"word": " Always", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.62, "probability": 0.4625452756881714}, {"word": " be", "start": 0.62, "end": 1.04, "probability": 0.9949291944503784}, {"word": " a", "start": 1.04, "end": 1.36, "probability": 0.9922171831130981}, {"word": " good", "start": 1.36, "end": 1.56, "probability": 0.9953418970108032}, {"word": " person,", "start": 1.56, "end": 2.14, "probability": 0.9988443851470947}, {"word": " even", "start": 2.4, "end": 2.9, "probability": 0.9939199686050415}, {"word": " if", "start": 2.9, "end": 3.12, "probability": 0.9985429048538208}, {"word": " nothing", "start": 3.12, "end": 3.46, "probability": 0.9976634979248047}, {"word": " comes", "start": 3.46, "end": 3.9, "probability": 0.9954600930213928}, {"word": " back", "start": 3.9, "end": 4.24, "probability": 0.9987781643867493}, {"word": 